  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Potion_Combiner/BH_Potion_Combiner_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">藥水組合器新增了一張工作台，可將最多三種藥水混合成單一藥水瓶，整合並統一所有效果，調製出威力更強的新藥水。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Potion_Combiner/BH_Potion_Combiner_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">使用本模組，您可以合併任意類型的藥水（包含一般與噴灑型），將其效果融合至單一藥水瓶中。為此，遊戲內新增了一種名為「藥水融合組合台」的特殊方塊，讓您能以最簡單直覺的方式進行藥水調合。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">該組合台的製作方式為在原有藥水桌周圍以「U」字形擺放方塊（請參考圖片）。放置完成後，組合台會對放入的素材產生視覺變化：其顏色會根據您投入的藥水類型而改變，提示您即將融合的效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391289/description_d881d834-7d01-42a7-871e-c6a4dd0ed40f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"198\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此系統支援同時混合最多三種藥水，將所有效果匯聚於單一成品中。這非常適合打造效率更高、在冒險途中具備多元用途的高階藥水。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Potion_Combiner/BH_Potion_Combiner_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即建立屬於您的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與好友暢玩無盡冒險！我們提供卓越的效能與穩定的運作時間，確保每位玩家都能享有流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。結帳時輸入優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣</span></strong></a>！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Potion_Combiner/BH_Potion_Combiner_discord.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
